{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-26-1","title":"Psalms 26:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David resorts to God in confidence of his integrity.</p>\n<p>Judge. 7:8; 35:24; 43:1; 54:1; 1Sa 24:15; *marg: 1Co 4:3-6 for. 11; 15:2; 25:21; 2Ki 20:3; Pr 20:7; 2Co 1:12 trusted. 4:5; 25:2; 28:7; 31:14; Pr 29:25 I shall. 21:7; 37:31; 62:2,6; 94:18; 121:3,7,8; 1Sa 2:9; 1Pe 1:5; 2Pe 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-2","title":"Psalms 26:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>7:9; 17:3; 66:10; 139:23,24; Job 13:23; 31:4-6; Jer 20:12; Zec 13:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-3","title":"Psalms 26:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>For. 52:1; 85:10-13; Mt 5:44-48; Lu 6:36; 2Co 3:18; 5:14,15; 8:9 Eph 4:32; 5:1,2; Col 3:12,13; 1Jo 4:7-12,19-21; 3Jo 1:11 and. 25:5; 101:2; 119:142; 2Ki 20:3; Isa 2:5; 8:20; Joh 14:6; Eph 4:20-25 1Jo 1:7; 2Jo 1:4; 3Jo 1:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-4","title":"Psalms 26:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>1:1; 119:63,115; Pr 9:6; 12:11; 13:20; Jer 15:17; 1Co 15:33 2Co 6:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-5","title":"Psalms 26:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>hated. 31:6; 101:3-8; 139:21,22 will. 1:1; Mt 9:11,12; 1Co 5:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-6","title":"Psalms 26:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>wash. 24:4; 73:13; Ex 30:19,20; Isa 1:16-18; Tit 3:5; Heb 10:19-22 so will. 43:4; Mal 2:11-13; Mt 5:23,24; 1Co 11:28,29; 1Ti 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-7","title":"Psalms 26:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>That. 9:14; 66:13-15; 95:2; 100:4,5; 116:12-14,18,19; 118:19,27; 134:2 De 26:2-10; 1Sa 1:24,27; 2Ch 20:26-29 tell. 71:17-19; 72:18; 105:2; 119:27; 136:4,5; 145:5; Lu 19:37-40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-8","title":"Psalms 26:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Lord. 27:4-6; 42:4; 84:1,2,10; 122:1-4,9; 2Sa 15:25; 1Ch 29:3 Isa 38:20,22; Lu 2:46,49; 19:45-47; Joh 2:14-17 where, etc. Heb. of the tabernacle of thine honour. 63:2,3; Ex 25:21,22; 40:34,35; 2Ch 5:14; 6:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-9","title":"Psalms 26:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Gather not. or, Take not away. 28:1-3; 1Sa 25:29; Mal 3:18; Mt 24:51; 25:32,44,46; Re 22:14,15 bloody men. Heb. men of blood. 51:14; 55:23; 139:19; 1Sa 22:18,19; 2Sa 16:7; 21:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-10","title":"Psalms 26:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>In. 10:14; 11:2; 36:4; 52:2; 55:9-11; Pr 1:16; 4:16; Mic 2:1-3; Mt 26:3,4 Ac 23:12 full of. Heb. filled with. bribes. Ex 23:8; De 16:19; 1Sa 8:3; Isa 33:15; Eze 22:12,13; Am 5:12 Mic 7:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-11","title":"Psalms 26:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I will. 1; 1Sa 12:2-5; 2Ch 31:20,21; Ne 5:15; Job 1:1; Isa 38:3; Lu 1:6 1Th 2:10 redeem. 49:7,15; 69:18; Tit 2:14; 1Pe 1:18,19 and. 103:3,4,7,8; Ne 13:14,22,31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-26-12","title":"Psalms 26:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>My. 27:11; 40:2; 1Sa 2:9; Pr 10:9 in the. 7; 22:22-25; 107:32; 111:1; 122:4; Heb 2:12</p>"}]}